      },
      "message": "fix(post): implement AC table-table inverse kinematics solver\n\nAdd a standalone `camcraft_post::kinematics` module implementing forward\nand analytical Rodrigues inverse kinematics for 5-axis XYZAC trunnions,\nmodal-C pole holding, weighted branch continuity across A = 0, continuous\nC unwrapping with safe-retract re-wrapping, and rotary chord subdivision.\n\nFixes #1965",
